flowchart TB
  %% Payment-sync engine — orchestration flow of PaymentSyncService.
  %% SCOPE: the RECURRING engine (update_payments_recurring) ONLY. One-time / trial
  %% billing is the SEPARATE PaymentSyncOneTime engine (a one-shot consolidated
  %% invoice, NOT a converge) — see sync-guide §12; it is not drawn here.
  %% Source of truth: src/sync/service/ (sync-guide skill).
  %% TWO main entry points (real + preview) SHARE resolve → settle → build_sync_params;
  %% they diverge on execute vs preview-execute and writeback (REAL-only).
  %% A THIRD thin entry, settle_once_discounts (the
  %% invoice.paid webhook), runs resolve → settle-once ONLY (no build/execute).
  %% build_sync_params DELEGATES coupon resolution to the separate PaymentSyncDiscounts
  %% engine. The scheduled reconciler is a separate BUILT system (reconciler-guide)
  %% that drives bulk_payment_sync; it is OUTSIDE this engine.
  %% Green = engine steps · lighter green = preview-only (read-only) steps · orange =
  %% external actors. Solid = live runtime call · dashed = future / delegation.

  triggers["🔔 Triggers — lifecycle callers (DB-first + verify/revert)<br/>start (RECURRING group only — one-time/trial group → PaymentSyncOneTime, §12)<br/>· cancel · price swap · apply/remove discounts · link/unlink<br/>each: pre-sync → write DB → THIS sync → verify stripe_sync_status → revert if not<br/>explicit freeze/unfreeze → PaymentSyncFreeze directly · plan reprice → bulk"]

  subgraph engine["⚙️ PaymentSyncService — the sync engine"]
    direction TB
    entry_real["▶ update_payments_recurring(member_id, idempotency_key,<br/>pay_first_invoice_out_of_band, proration_behavior) -> None<br/>REAL: converge Stripe + write back · caller reads DB ('applied') to confirm"]
    entry_prev["▷ preview_update_payments_recurring(member_id, proration_behavior)<br/>-> invoice preview | None · PREVIEW: read-only dry run, no DB writes"]

    resolve["1 · resolve parent + gym account — SHARED<br/>BillingParentResolver.resolve — follow account_linked_to_id once → (ParentProfile, account)"]
    settle["2 · settle once discounts — SHARED (preview settles too)<br/>PaymentSyncOnceDiscounts.sync_once_discounts<br/>get_unconsumed_once_discounts → read live sub coupons (get_subscription)<br/>coupon gone from sub = consumed → mark_once_consumed (stamp end_date)<br/>ALSO the standalone target of settle_once_discounts (invoice.paid webhook)"]

    subgraph build_sp["3 · build_sync_params (PaymentSyncBuilder) — SHARED · pure read, NO DB writes"]
      direction TB
      b_read["get_active_memberships(family_ids, today, preview)<br/>active recurring (cancel_date IS NULL) each carrying its applied discounts<br/>the preview flag toggles which stripe_sync_status set is read"]
      b_group["_group_by_price → consolidated lines (qty = # memberships on the price)"]
      b_bucket["_build_bucket → IntervalBucket: one desired item per price,<br/>items carry the resolved coupons + the existing sub id"]
      b_read --> b_group
      b_group --> b_bucket
    end

    subgraph discounts["PaymentSyncDiscounts.resolve(groups) — coupon engine (the builder delegates here)"]
      direction TB
      d_agg["_aggregate_line_values — per line, per mode (once / ongoing):<br/>percents compound sequentially within a membership then ÷ quantity ;<br/>dollars summed · disjoint contributing_ids (percent vs dollar)"]
      d_find["per value: PaymentSyncCoupons.find_or_create → PaymentsStripeDiscountService<br/>deterministic id (pct_&lt;bps&gt;_&lt;mode&gt; / amt_&lt;cents&gt;_&lt;mode&gt;) · validate-or-replace<br/>idempotent gym-wide (safe in preview too)"]
      d_links["return ResolvedDiscounts: coupons_by_price + applied_discount→coupon links"]
      d_agg --> d_find
      d_find --> d_links
    end

    execute["4 · execute_sync (PaymentSyncStripe) — REAL ONLY<br/>items → existing sub? update_subscription : create_subscription<br/>empty bucket + existing sub → cancel_subscription · else no-op<br/>explicit proration_behavior · keys :sub_create / :sub_update / :sub_cancel"]

    subgraph writeback["5 · PaymentSyncWriteback.write(params, sub_result) — REAL ONLY"]
      direction TB
      w_rows["_apply_membership_rows — map live items by stripe_price_id → each row:<br/>apply_membership_sync = stripe_item_id + next_due_date (gym-local) + 'applied'"]
      w_memberprice["set_member_post_discount_prices — each membership's OWN post-discount<br/>price → total_price (per item_id; build-time amounts from member_amounts)"]
      w_links["coupon links → set_applied_discount_coupon_id (stripe_coupon_id + 'applied') per row"]
      w_del["_mark_removed_deleted — cancelled rows gone from live sub → mark_membership_deleted ('deleted')"]
      w_subid["update_profile_sub_id — parent stripe_sub_id_month (None when cancelled)"]
      w_prices["_sync_parent_monthly_total — parent monthly total from Stripe upcoming invoice (set_parent_monthly_total)"]
      w_rows --> w_memberprice
      w_memberprice --> w_links
      w_links --> w_del
      w_del --> w_subid
      w_subid --> w_prices
    end

    pexec["4p · preview_execute_sync (PaymentSyncStripe) — PREVIEW ONLY<br/>items → existing sub? preview_update_subscription : preview_create_subscription<br/>empty bucket → None (NEVER cancels) · no Stripe mutation"]

    ret_real["return None (real) — caller verifies via DB stripe_sync_status"]
    ret_prev["return upcoming-invoice preview (discount-aware) | None"]

    bulk["bulk_payment_sync(member_ids)<br/>loop members · fresh uuid4 key each · calls update_payments_recurring<br/>swallow per-member errors and continue"]

    entry_real --> resolve
    entry_prev --> resolve
    resolve --> settle
    settle --> build_sp
    build_sp -->|"delegates coupon resolution; coupons attach to bucket items"| discounts
    build_sp -->|"real"| execute
    build_sp -->|"preview"| pexec
    execute --> writeback
    writeback --> ret_real
    pexec --> ret_prev
    bulk --> entry_real
  end

  reconciler["🧹 Scheduled reconciler — BUILT (its own reconciler domain; see reconciler-guide)<br/>twice-daily sweep · drives bulk_payment_sync (push) + Stripe→CRM cancellation absorption<br/>mid-cycle end_date expiry + once-consumption backstop on idle members"]

  webhook["📨 invoice.paid webhook handler (stripe_webhooks)<br/>after a subscription invoice is paid → settle_once_discounts(member_id)<br/>best-effort · own txn · stamps a consumed once's end_date promptly"]

  supabase["🗄️ Supabase — service-role, unfiltered base tables<br/>resolve_parent · get_family_ids · get_active_recurring (+ applied discounts)<br/>get_unconsumed_once_discounts · mark_once_consumed<br/>apply_membership_sync · mark_membership_deleted · set_applied_discount_coupon_id<br/>update_profile_sub_ids · set_member_post_discount_prices · sync_profile_monthly_total"]
  stripe["💳 Stripe — gym Connect account<br/>get_subscription (live coupons for once-settle)<br/>create / update / cancel subscription · pause_collection<br/>coupons via PaymentsStripeDiscountService (find-or-create) · upcoming invoice (preview)"]

  triggers -->|"mutations → update / preview · plan reprice → bulk"| engine
  webhook -.->|"invoice.paid → settle_once_discounts"| engine
  reconciler -->|"scheduled sweep → bulk sync (step C)"| engine
  engine -->|"read/write: parent · family · memberships + discounts · once-candidates · coupon_id · sync status · sub id · totals"| supabase
  engine -->|"live coupons · find-or-create coupons · create / update / cancel sub · pause_collection · upcoming invoice"| stripe

  classDef svc fill:#e6f7ec,stroke:#2f8f53,color:#0c3a1f;
  classDef prev fill:#eafff2,stroke:#2f8f53,color:#0c3a1f;
  classDef ext fill:#ffd9a8,stroke:#d2691e,color:#4a2c08;
  class triggers,webhook,entry_real,resolve,settle,execute,ret_real,bulk svc;
  class entry_prev,pexec,ret_prev prev;
  class supabase,stripe ext;
  class reconciler svc;
  style engine fill:#f4f9f6,stroke:#2f8f53;
  style build_sp fill:#eafaf0,stroke:#2f8f53;
  style discounts fill:#eafaf0,stroke:#2f8f53;
  style writeback fill:#eafaf0,stroke:#2f8f53;
